", "title": "capitalization policy"}, {"id": "c82c0e0d-9128-4851-b44f-ffc88134908d", "type": "concept", "title": "useful life"}, {"id": "c897770c-5f61-406e-9d33-9d404433939e", "type": "concept", "title": "salvage value"}, {"id": "4a5568f9-3a64-4859-8efc-89ac9b33cdb8", "type": "concept", "title": "depreciation method"}, {"id": "457ee5a5-6b28-4a5c-976a-8a4210494220", "type": "concept", "title": "asset impairment"}, {"id": "3e137ed0-31d9-4567-b349-e4ba2802cbd4", "type": "concept", "title": "goodwill impairment"}, {"id": "e4c6337a-25f4-46ec-bb5b-938633153a68", "type": "concept", "title": "capitalized software"}], "description": "Students evaluate depreciation, capitalization, and asset value judgments."}]}, {"id": "fb97f0c6-eaaf-4aa2-8a9a-91780865a571", "type": "topic", "title": "Debt, Leases, Pensions, Deferred Taxes, and Off-Balance-Sheet Risk", "description": "Analyze financing obligations and accounting adjustments that materially affect risk and valuation.", "children": [{"id": "29b549be-115f-4487-bad7-ffca97d75b2d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Debt and leases", "children": [{"id": "204e9bb6-a0ba-4fa9-a531-a441aa73389b", "type": "concept", "title": "secured debt"}, {"id": "427f95a1-a074-4983-ac42-c6dfa1ab812f", "type": "concept", "title": "unsecured debt"}, {"id": "1f169dbf-2248-4a83-9991-290cf575861b", "type": "concept", "title": "lease liability"}, {"id": "79bb4cef-f2fc-4f5f-9cdd-1d2ecea9b4c7", "type": "concept", "title": "operating lease"}, {"id": "f6ff4895-5678-4e8e-b5ef-cf1c70d2141a", "type": "concept", "title": "finance lease"}, {"id": "9869a113-e444-4f7f-8320-dd8e41dfc420", "type": "concept", "title": "maturity schedule"}, {"id": "ff4814c1-a932-4990-9362-281bdea6e8f3", "type": "concept", "title": "covenant"}], "description": "Students identify financing obligations that affect leverage and cash flow."}, {"id": "02b9fe55-c455-4f92-84dd-8b9a2816a0f9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pensions and postretirement obligations", "children": [{"id": "67dfd41c-ac20-4